" ghpr setup  3/7 When to use it · work                                                                                  "
"Which directories is work for?                         ┌ Preview ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"Comma-separated; ~ is your home. ghpr uses work        │Where each profile applies:                                    │"
"anywhere under them.                                   │  here (~/code/ghpr) → personal (default)                      │"
"                                                       │  ~/work → work (directory ~/work)                             │"
"› ~/work, ~/clients                                    │  ~/clients → work (directory ~/clients)                       │"
